# Orastery Woes (windurst 86): the offer without the club, and the level edge's met side. A level-71 WAR (the Club of
# Trials' level) at Club 2300: 578 (oncePerZone); its finish with a full bag (no club: giveItem false, not begun); a
# second talk in the zone plays nothing (oncePerZone: priority Ignore; his script silent, no default); after a rezone
# 578 again, begun (the club, 0 weapon skill points, and the Weapon Training Guide).
lists PortWindurst/Kuroido-Moido/onTrigger PortWindurst/onEventFinish/578
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-110.7,-4.25,102.06 job=WAR lvl=71
quest Windurst.MakingAmends completed
skill Club 2300
login
trigger Kuroido-Moido+7                                   # level 71, Club 2300, no guide: event 578 (oncePerZone)
fill-inventory
finish                                              # no club, the bag full: giveItem false, not begun
free-inventory
trigger Kuroido-Moido+7                                   # 578 played this zone: nothing (his script: Making Amends completed, fame below level 4: nothing; no default)
rezone
trigger Kuroido-Moido+7                                   # after the rezone: 578 again
finish                                              # the Club of Trials and the Weapon Training Guide: begun
